# Base URL the client fetches the bundle from at runtime (spec §4.5 — the
# client is deployed once and reads the manifest/bundle at runtime, so
# changing this never requires a rebuild or redeploy).
#
# Resolution order (see src/lib/bundle.ts):
#   1. NEXT_PUBLIC_BUNDLE_URL below, if set.
#   2. "/data" automatically while running `next dev` (served from the
#      local copy `npm run sync:bundle` mirrors from the repo root's
#      public/ — a dev convenience, not required).
#   3. Otherwise, the published bundle's public Git repo on
#      raw.githubusercontent.com.
#
# Leave unset for normal local dev and for the Vercel deploy — both have
# sensible defaults. Set this to point a build at a different bundle, e.g.
# a staging data repo, a specific commit/branch, or a self-hosted mirror.
#
# Must be a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable: it is read in client-side code and needs
# to be inlined into the static export at build time.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BUNDLE_URL=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sbalasubramanian14/observatory-almanac/main
